#: ../../tools/icite_tools.rst:32 405ff9ae1498483e9f08d5e5b98cc346
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get citation metrics and research context for PubMed "
"publications using NIH's iCite API. iCite provides evidence-based metrics"
" including citation counts, relative citation ratios (RCR), approximate "
"potential to translate (APT) scores for clinical translation, NIH "
"percentile rankings, and research category flags (human/animal/molecular-"
"cellular). Returns all available citations and the full list of citing "
"PMIDs. Essential for evaluating scientific impact, identifying highly-"
"cited papers, and assessing translational potential of biomedical "
"research. Example: PMID 31510562 has citation\\_count=6, "
"nih\\_percentile=29.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icite_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/icite_tools.rst:65
